<1>. QED BY <1>1, <1>2, <1>3, <1>4, <1>5, <1>6, <1>7, <1>8, <1>9, <1>10, <1>11, <1>12, <1>13, <1>14, <1>15, <1>16, <1>17, <1>18, <1>19, <1>20, <1>21, <1>22 DEF IndInv, TypeOK

THEOREM StepInv == IndInv /\ [Next]_vars => IndInv'
<1> SUFFICES ASSUME IndInv, [Next]_vars PROVE IndInv'
  OBVIOUS
<1>1. CASE Terminated BY <1>1, LTerminated
<1>2. CASE QueryStart \/ LeaderSnap \/ Collect \/ Finish BY <1>2, LQueryStart, LLeaderSnap, LCollect, LFinish
<1>3. CASE \E w \in Workers : Start(w) \/ \E p \in Pg : ReadPage(w, p) BY <1>3, LStart, LReadPage
<1>4. CASE \E r \in Rows, p \in Pg : Insert(r, p) BY <1>4, LInsert
<1>5. CASE \E r \in Rows : Delete(r) BY <1>5, LDelete
<1>6. CASE \E p \in Pg : VacuumRows(p) \/ VacuumPage(p) \/ FtabAlloc(p) \/ FtabFree(p)
  BY <1>6, LVacuumRows, LVacuumPage, LFtabAlloc, LFtabFree
<1>7. CASE UNCHANGED vars BY <1>7, LUnchanged
<1>. QED BY <1>1, <1>2, <1>3, <1>4, <1>5, <1>6, <1>7 DEF Next, ScanStep

THEOREM Safe == Spec => []IndInv
  BY InitInv, StepInv, PTL DEF Spec

\* C1
THEOREM CoverageSafe == IndInv => Coverage
  BY DEF IndInv, R_bitmap, Coverage
\* C2
THEOREM NoLossSafe == IndInv => NoLoss
<1> SUFFICES ASSUME IndInv, snap > 0, ~done, NEW r \in Rows, VisibleAt(r, snap)
             PROVE ~gone[r] /\ state[home[r]] = "heap"
  BY DEF NoLoss
<1>1. ~gone[r] BY DEF IndInv, R_vis
<1>2. home[r] # NoPage BY DEF IndInv, R_home, VisibleAt
<1>. QED BY <1>1, <1>2 DEF IndInv, R_alloc
\* C3
THEOREM HeapOnlySafe == IndInv => HeapOnly
  BY DEF IndInv, R_foreign, HeapOnly
\* C4
THEOREM SameSafe == IndInv => SameAsSnapshot
<1> SUFFICES ASSUME IndInv, done, NEW r \in Rows PROVE readCnt[r] = IF VisibleAt(r, snap) THEN 1 ELSE 0
  BY DEF SameAsSnapshot
<1>1. opened /\ \A x \in Workers : started[x] /\ left[x] = {}
  BY DEF IndInv, R_open, R_done
<1>2. CASE VisibleAt(r, snap)
  <2>1. home[r] \in bitmap /\ home[r] \in Pg BY <1>1, <1>2 DEF IndInv, R_bitmap, TypeOK, SetOK
  <2>2. owner[home[r]] \in Workers BY <2>1 DEF IndInv, TypeOK, SetOK
  <2>. QED BY <1>1, <1>2, <2>1, <2>2 DEF IndInv, R_count
<1>3. CASE ~VisibleAt(r, snap) BY <1>3 DEF IndInv, R_count
<1>. QED BY <1>2, <1>3
